  "targetAge": 8,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ARMORED CORE Ⅵ FIRES OF RUBICON』のアイテムが『30 MINUTES MISSIONS』シリーズで商品化。",
      "en": "\"ARMORED CORE Ⅵ FIRES OF RUBICON \" items are commercialized in the \" 30 MINUTES MISSIONS\" series."
    },
    {
      "ja": "シリーズのキーコンセプト「シンプル組み立て」「カスタム遊び」のもと、双刃ブレードが特徴的なレーザースライサーを含めた武器群をセットで商品化。",
      "en": "Based on the series' key concepts of \"simple assembly \" and \" custom play,\" we have commercialized a set of weapons, including a laser slicer with a distinctive double-edged blade."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 武器の内容は「MA-E-211 SAMPU」「Vvc-774LS」「Vvc-703PM」「MA-J-200 RANSETSU-RF」。",
      "en": "• The contents of the weapons are \"MA-E-211 SAMPU \", \" Vvc-774LS \", \" Vvc-703PM \", and \" MA-J-200 RANSETSU-RF\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 装備する際に左右で形状が変わる武装は再現用のパーツがそれぞれ付属し、選択式で組み立てが可能。",
      "en": "• Weapons that change shape on the left and right when equipped come with parts for reproduction, and can be assembled selectively."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「Vvc-774LS」の展開状態を再現可能な差し替えパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Replacement parts that can reproduce the unfolded state of \"Vvc-774LS\" are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腕武器を肩部へ装備可能にする左右の「ウェポンハンガー」が付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with left and right \"Weapon hangers\" that allow arm weapons to be mounted on the shoulders."
    }
  ],
